<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8">
 <title>Password Reset Confirmation</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #F7F7F7; color: #333;">
 <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px; margin:auto; background-color:#ffffff; border:1px solid #E0E0E0;">
  <tr>
   <td style="padding: 30px;">
    <h2 style="color: #007B8F; margin-top: 0;">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},</h2>
    <p>Your password has been successfully reset for <strong>{!Community_Name}</strong>.</p>
    <p>To return to your account, click the button below:</p>
    <p style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
     <a href="{!Community_Url}" style="background-color: #007B8F; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 25px; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block;">
      Return to {!Community_Name}
     </a>
    </p>
    <p>If you didn’t request this change, please contact our support team immediately.</p>
    <p style="margin-top: 40px;">Thanks,<br>
    The {!Organization.Name} Team</p>
   </td>
  </tr>
 </table>
</body>
</html>